==============================================================================
S1. Sign-label correction to my report
==============================================================================
  My numbers were net = (alpha*kappa-1) - kappa*Delta; my PROSE wrote it as
  'Delta*kappa - (alpha*kappa-1)', which is the negative. Numbers right, label wrong.
   kappa=0.65: alpha*k-1-k*Delta = -0.246340   k*Delta-(alpha*k-1) = +0.246340
   kappa=0.8: alpha*k-1-k*Delta = -0.072419   k*Delta-(alpha*k-1) = +0.072419
   kappa=0.9: alpha*k-1-k*Delta = +0.043529   k*Delta-(alpha*k-1) = -0.043529
  Delta_0(alpha) via the general formula = 0.425485676  (endpoint case, cf 0.425486)

