S3. Monotonicity: is theta = alpha the worst shell?
==============================================================================
  d/dtheta[theta-Delta_delta(theta)] = log2[ 2(theta-1)(theta-1/2-delta) / (theta(theta-1-delta)) ]
  and numerator-denominator = (theta-1)^2 + delta(2-theta) > 0 on 1+delta<theta<=alpha.
  algebraic identity and positivity checked at 399 points: violations = 0
  theta - Delta_delta(theta) increasing on the range: True   (min 1.053614 at theta=1.1100, max 1.454129 at theta=1.5850)

